# =============================================================================
# EXPERIMENT DECLARATION — phase1_baseline   (scaffolded by `api.py declare`)
#
# This file is YOURS until `reconstruct.py` seals it: edit the label, trim
# add setting overrides. After assessment the student section is
# digest-sealed — a new idea is a NEW file under a NEW name (§3.1).
#
# PREDICTION (write BEFORE assessing — the seal makes it non-retractable):
#   pipeline: I expect low ICPInlierFitness and high ICPInlierRMSE to be associated with poor frame-to-frame alignment, while low RawPointCount or VoxelizedPointYield may indicate insufficient geometric support.
#   baseline: I expect the full-batch reconstruction to produce a usable but imperfect map, with some trajectory drift and a moderate Mean L2 error.
# =============================================================================

